Film material — separate permission not documented
-------------------------------------------------
* assets/intro.mp3: Star Wars-related soundtrack recording. Star Wars film
  music was composed by John Williams. The precise recording, performer,
  publisher, master owner, source, and redistribution permission for this
  particular file are not documented in the repository. Composition and
  sound-recording rights must be cleared separately; ownership must not be
  attributed wholesale to a single company without verifying the recording.
  Composer reference: https://www.lucasfilm.com/productions/music-by-john-williams/
* preload/en/*.json and preload/it/*.json: transcribed film opening crawls and
  titles, in English and Italian. Underlying film text and translation rights
  remain with the relevant rights holders. Their preservation as data files
  does not put them under the application's code license.
* assets/img/starwarslogo.svg: Star Wars logo artwork and associated marks.
* assets/img/benkenobi.svg: depiction of a Star Wars character.
* assets/sitelogo.svg: composite site artwork containing Star Wars imagery.
* docs/images/dashboard.png: screenshot of the application that may reproduce
  some of the above material; it does not create new rights in that material.

Star Wars-related material is associated with Lucasfilm Ltd. and The Walt
Disney Company. This project is unofficial and is not endorsed by them.
No permission from those companies is asserted. Official permission inquiry:
https://www.disneystudiolicensing.com/
